{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S05-1\",\n      \"text\": \"欢喜退下去一点，我还是想知道他有没有把我放在心上。我原先以为，只要不向他要回应，就能安心喜欢，也不会失去眼前的亲近；现在这个念头又回来了，我开始怀疑，自己对他好时是不是也盼着他珍惜我。可我知道，先前那些快乐并不是为了换他的回应；我也不敢把这个疑问直接拿去问他，怕一开口就成了索取，把眼前的亲近弄坏。我只能先看看，自己到底在盼什么。\",\n      \"key\": \"放在心上\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"causes\": [\"c1\", \"c2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S05-2\",\n      \"text\": \"我不敢再认定眼前的亲近会一直这样，也不想急着替自己辩白，或再热烈起来把这份难堪盖过去。想让这份亲近一直继续下去的念头，也没那么强了。\",\n      \"key\": \"难堪\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"causes\": [\"c3\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S03-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S05-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"唤起\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S04-5\",\n      \"to\": \"S05-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"动摇\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S04-1\",\n      \"to\": \"S05-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"限制\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S04-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S05-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"说明\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S04-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S05-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"说明\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S02-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S05-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S04-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S05-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"限制\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S04-5\",\n      \"to\": \"S05-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"失效\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "e9831207-1114-45be-81ea-3c22bc1a60fe", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261030T024927061776Z", "elapsed_seconds": 31.078, "completed_utc": "2026-10-30T02:49:58.141023+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "contin